{"4226560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ALATURKA", "steam_appid": 4226560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/10eec56b2033b97fa0801073b6cfff0b.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/10eec56b2033b97fa0801073b6cfff0b.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/10eec56b2033b97fa0801073b6cfff0b.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bosforus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a country boy who has never stepped foot outside his small village, you have arrived in Bosforus, the capital of the world built on two continents. Your pockets are empty, but your goal is big: <strong>Save Money</strong>. Here, people rush, traffic comes to a standstill, and seagulls scream. Learn the language of the streets and grind tooth and nail for every single penny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/aa8a79f23b43dbbea273d97ac681d37d.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/aa8a79f23b43dbbea273d97ac681d37d.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/aa8a79f23b43dbbea273d97ac681d37d.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Grind &amp; The Hustle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swallow your pride in this city where you came to save money. From slicing Döner to smuggling, do whatever it takes to hang on. Meet locals in legal and illegal jobs, and remember: every Lira counts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/b7b13112570bede23ca2157ac3e44d59.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/b7b13112570bede23ca2157ac3e44d59.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/b7b13112570bede23ca2157ac3e44d59.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heavy '70s Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy driving bulky, heavy '70s vehicles against the sunset in a city spanning two continents. Master the unforgiving driving physics of retro games. Outrun the cops and feel the true weight of the classics as you drift through the narrow streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/921827dba019a87b1dd552ebdd9c4049.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/921827dba019a87b1dd552ebdd9c4049.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/921827dba019a87b1dd552ebdd9c4049.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hesitate to defend yourself when needed, but watch out for the cops. Dodge bullets, mess with neighborhood gangs, and survive the chaos on traditional ALATURKA food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/2494942d7dabbaedeac517a976a1154e.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/2494942d7dabbaedeac517a976a1154e.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/2494942d7dabbaedeac517a976a1154e.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living, Breathing City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are no longer a tourist; meet the real face of Bosforus. Throw simit to seagulls, beat up that annoying ice cream man, chase pigeons, and feed stray cats. The city lives its own life, and you are right in the middle of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/0ec28a52e9abd65fd4132f77d1f14261.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/0ec28a52e9abd65fd4132f77d1f14261.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/0ec28a52e9abd65fd4132f77d1f14261.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>SOLO BUT NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Can a single person create those legendary games we played with admiration as kids using today's technology?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALATURKA</strong> is a transparent community project developed entirely on live streams with the comments and contributions of the community. The game continues to develop and grow with regular weekly streams. Share your feedback on our Steam Community page; let's lay the bricks of this nostalgic Bosforus together!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/10eec56b2033b97fa0801073b6cfff0b.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/10eec56b2033b97fa0801073b6cfff0b.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/10eec56b2033b97fa0801073b6cfff0b.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bosforus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a country boy who has never stepped foot outside his small village, you have arrived in Bosforus, the capital of the world built on two continents. Your pockets are empty, but your goal is big: <strong>Save Money</strong>. Here, people rush, traffic comes to a standstill, and seagulls scream. Learn the language of the streets and grind tooth and nail for every single penny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/aa8a79f23b43dbbea273d97ac681d37d.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/aa8a79f23b43dbbea273d97ac681d37d.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/aa8a79f23b43dbbea273d97ac681d37d.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Grind &amp; The Hustle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swallow your pride in this city where you came to save money. From slicing Döner to smuggling, do whatever it takes to hang on. Meet locals in legal and illegal jobs, and remember: every Lira counts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/b7b13112570bede23ca2157ac3e44d59.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/b7b13112570bede23ca2157ac3e44d59.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/b7b13112570bede23ca2157ac3e44d59.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heavy '70s Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy driving bulky, heavy '70s vehicles against the sunset in a city spanning two continents. Master the unforgiving driving physics of retro games. Outrun the cops and feel the true weight of the classics as you drift through the narrow streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/921827dba019a87b1dd552ebdd9c4049.poster.avif?t=1786350019\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/921827dba019a87b1dd552ebdd9c4049.webm?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226560/extras/921827dba019a87b1dd552ebdd9c4049.mp4?t=1786350019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Chaos</h2><p class=\"b